-- RAKAM LAZE2 F 7OROOF ---------------------------------- main.franco.kl  K0127

`3ala` beyebda2 b rakam, fa 2areito rakam, bas feeh 7oroof. Mafeesh esm yebda2 b rakam f ay skin.

9│     khali n = 3ala
                 ^^^^

Mosa3da: Ebda2 el esm b 7arf, aw 7ot masafa ben el rakam wel kelma. W law el kelma keyword maktoob ghalat, w da beye7sal keteer f el Franco, ha2tera7 3aleek el ketaba el sa7.

E3raf aktar: kalam explain K0127
